label "Mode 4, runnable knowledge: a selection of Concepts goes through the combiner's five fixed steps to a Harness of seven kinds of file (highlighted), a starting point that a runtime would render"
caption "The highlighted Harness exists only for a valid selection; a runtime such as GABBE or kaiban-distributed would render its files; no such rendering ships at 1.0."
box sel 16 100 100 50 "select|Concepts"
box comb 148 90 120 70 "combiner|5 fixed steps|no model, no key"
box harn 300 90 140 70 "Harness|7 kinds of file: C4,|arc42, ADRs, skills" acc
box rt 300 190 140 40 "runtime renderings"
arrow sel comb
arrow comb harn
arrow harn rt
note "verdict first — an invalid selection yields no Harness at all"
